label introduction:

    play music intro volume 0.5

    centered "Since ancient times, magic has always silently permeated Earth..."

    scene intro_1 with dissolve

    centered "{color=#f00}It appeared through cracks in the fabric of reality in various locations around the world...{/color}"

    centered "{color=#f00}These cracks served as gateways to allow the creation of such different spells.{/color}"

    scene black_full

    centered "However..."

    centered "These fissures didn't only transport the magic to our world..."

    scene intro_2 with dissolve

    centered "They also served as channels for the manifestation of strong elemental creatures tied to a core element."

    centered "Creatures which can blend in and possess with animals in nature, such as lions, birds, and even some objects and buildings."

    scene black_full

    centered "But... The people of that time discovered something." 

    scene intro_3 with dissolve

    centered "The elemental creatures, they need mana to survive. And the most natural way was through the conversion of the human soul."

    scene black_full

    centered "After years fighting and trying to decipher the secrets of these magical fissures and their beasts, the mages of that era discovered a way to redirect the fissures, channeling them to specific points on Earth"

    scene intro_4 with dissolve

    centered "The Rift Temples"

    scene black_full with dissolve

    centered "A established network of sacred places in central locations around the planet, where these fissures converged. However, the temples could not be protected by incredible magic or anything, it was necessary that the only source of magic that existed in that place was the fissure itself."

    centered "Consequently, the magical fissures began to fade, gradually losing their intensity and erasing the chances of new magical beasts, but also... removing the arcana from Earth."
   
    stop music fadeout 1.0

    centered "..."

    jump character_name

    return
